<title>JAPAN: Japan Telecom lower amid merger talks.</title>
<headline>Japan Telecom lower amid merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Japan Telecom Co Ltd fell on Thursday morning, after the Tokyo Stock Exchange suspended trading of the telecoms firm on the previous day.</p>
<p>The share price stood at 2,300,000 yen at 0150 GMT, down from Tuesday's close of 2,340,000 yen.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, Japan Telecom said it and International Telecom Japan Inc (ITJ) are negotiating a possible merger and aim to reach agreement by the end of March.</p>
